# Keep Docker build contexts small and free of secrets.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.dart_tool
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
graphify-out
apps/consumer
apps/merchant
apps/rider
packages/santha_*
# …except the shared fonts, which the web build self-hosts (apps/web/scripts/sync-brand.mjs)
!packages/santha_ui/fonts
docs
infra
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
